# (Previously ignored by mistake; un-ignored 2026-07 cleanup.)
!Cargo.lock
*.o
*.wasm
*.elf
*.bin
*.img
.DS_Store
tool-results/
.env

# Development debris
agent-ctx/
*.bak
*.orig
*.swp
*.swo
*~
WORKLOG.md
worklog.md
WAVE_PLAN.md
MANIFEST.md

# Test run artifacts.
# test_results/ is the Pi's tracked output directory — the pi5_test_suite.sh
# commits summary.json, failures.txt, checkpoint.jsonl, and build.log there
# after every run and pushes to origin/main. Agents MUST NOT modify files
# under test_results/ — it is exclusively the Pi's territory. This isolation
# guarantees the Pi can always `git pull && git push` without merge conflicts
# on test output, since agents only touch src/, tests/gold_standard/,
# scripts/, docs/, womb/, and root config files.
#
# (Previously gitignored during the 2026-07 cleanup because a stale 39 MB
# checkpoint.jsonl from a different host was committed; that artifact has
# been removed. The Pi's own checkpoint.jsonl is the canonical run record
# and SHOULD be committed for remote debugging.)
!test_results/
echo
vuma_vm.h
/tmp/vuma_results/
/tmp/qemu_bins/
/tmp/qemu/

# Fuzz / Proptest artifacts
**/fuzz/target/
**/fuzz/corpus/
**/proptest-regressions/

